	"instruction": "# Fix rounding in invoice totals\n\nCustomers report invoices that are off by a cent. Some totals come out one cent low when an amount lands exactly on half a cent.\n\nMake the `ledger` package compute invoice totals by these rules:\n\n1. A line amount is quantity times unit price, rounded half up to a whole cent.\n2. The subtotal is the sum of the rounded line amounts.\n3. Tax is computed once per invoice on the discounted subtotal.\n\nKeep the public API as it is.\n",
